","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore","html_url":"https://github.com/maxcomperatore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxcomperatore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T21:57:45Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T21:57:45Z","body":"Squashed as requested.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2852431019/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853477895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106065#issuecomment-2853477895","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106065","id":2853477895,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qFJ4H","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T07:01:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T07:01:04Z","body":"Actually, I reviewed the bug a bit too quickly. `-Wenum-conversion` *is* supported by GCC, it works fine on my system and works on CI.\r\n\r\nOP in #106065 uses a derivative of Ubuntu 20.04 with GCC 9, which is very ancient. The `-Wenum-conversion` warning was likely added more recently than that (possibly in Clang too) and should be gated with a version check.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853477895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853491289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106065#issuecomment-2853491289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106065","id":2853491289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qFNJZ","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T07:07:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T07:09:53Z","body":"> this flag isnt supported in gcc for c++, only in clang.\r\n\r\nThis seems to have been a misunderstanding of the docs, though I agree they're confusingly worded:\r\nhttps://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/Warning-Options.html#index-Wenum-conversion\r\n\r\n> -Wenum-conversion\r\n>\r\n> Warn when a value of enumerated type is implicitly converted to a different enumerated type. This warning is enabled by -Wextra in C.\r\n\r\nThis is enabled by default for C in `-Wextra`, but it doesn't mean that it can't be used for C++.\r\n\r\nChecking earlier GCC versions:\r\n- https://devdocs.io/gcc~9/warning-options - indeed doesn't support `-Wenum-conversion` at all\r\n- https://devdocs.io/gcc~10/warning-options - adds the option, but for C/Objective-C only\r\n- https://devdocs.io/gcc~11/warning-options - removes the \"C only\" limitation, but only enables it for C in `-Wextra` (still the case today)\r\n\r\nSo I'd gate it on GCC >= 11 so we don't need to also make it C-only for GCC 10.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853491289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853558632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106065#issuecomment-2853558632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106065","id":2853558632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qFdlo","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T07:35:59Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T07:36:09Z","body":"I'm working on an alternative fix, also taking the opportunity to re-evaluate and clean up some of the warning exceptions we had for various GCC versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853558632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853644737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106065#issuecomment-2853644737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106065","id":2853644737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qFynB","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T08:08:28Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T08:08:28Z","body":"Superseded by #106118. Thanks for the contribution nonetheless!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2853644737/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]